      "a": {
        "zh": "我做 AI 产品功能：按资料带出处回答的问答、广告审核和内容标注 Agent、经营分析 Agent、给创作者用的 Skill。每个功能都先出题、定好答案再评测，结果和局限写在评测卡里。作品集里一共 15 个项目，代码和报告都公开。",
        "en": "I build AI product features: question answering that cites its sources, ad-review and content-labelling agents, a business-review agent and skills for creators. Each feature gets a test set with fixed answers before it is judged, and its results and limits go on an evaluation card. The portfolio holds 15 projects, with code and reports public."
