    {
      "id": "iterate-adopt",
      "group": "method",
      "order": 8,
      "chip": false,
      "q": {
        "zh": "怎么迭代？怎么决定一个改动采用不采用？",
        "en": "How do you iterate, and how do you decide whether to adopt a change?"
      },
      "aliases": {
        "zh": [
          "迭代",
          "对照实验",
          "采用标准",
          "回滚",
          "灰度",
          "怎么改版"
        ],
        "en": [
          "iteration",
          "a/b test",
          "experiment",
          "adoption rule",
          "rollback",
          "canary"
        ]
      },
      "a": {
        "zh": "每次只改一处，跑之前写下预测和采用规则，再在同一套冻结的题上和上一版并排比。区间整个在零以上才算提升。例如标注 Agent 的第二版：点评上 +0.018 [+0.005, +0.031]，采用；广告上 +0.021 [+0.000, +0.048]，区间碰到零，不采用。上线类的改动先灰度，按写好的条件回滚。",
        "en": "One change at a time, with predictions and an adoption rule written before the run, compared side by side with the previous version on the same frozen items. A gain counts only when the whole interval is above zero. For example, the labelling agent's second version: on reviews +0.018 [+0.005, +0.031], adopted; on ads +0.021 [+0.000, +0.048], the interval reaches zero, not adopted. Release changes go through a canary with rollback conditions written down."
      },
      "sources": [
        {
          "type": "project",
          "id": "labelling-agent-kit",
          "label": {
            "zh": "标注 Agent 工具箱",
            "en": "Labelling Agent Kit"
          },
          "url": {
            "zh": "https://github.com/llia0031-dotcom/labelling-agent-kit",
            "en": "https://github.com/llia0031-dotcom/labelling-agent-kit"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "project",
          "id": "grounded-labelling-pipeline",
          "label": {
            "zh": "有据标注流水线",
            "en": "Grounded Labelling Pipeline"
          },
          "url": {
            "zh": "https://github.com/llia0031-dotcom/grounded-labelling-pipeline",
            "en": "https://github.com/llia0031-dotcom/grounded-labelling-pipeline"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "section",
          "id": "log",
          "label": {
