    {
      "id": "numbers-true",
      "group": "method",
      "order": 9,
      "chip": false,
      "q": {
        "zh": "怎么保证报告里的数字是真的？",
        "en": "How do you make sure the numbers are real?"
      },
      "aliases": {
        "zh": [
          "数字可信吗",
          "会不会编数字",
          "数据真实",
          "怎么核对",
          "数字从哪来"
        ],
        "en": [
          "are the numbers real",
          "fabricated",
          "verify numbers",
          "trust the results",
          "how do you check"
        ]
      },
      "a": {
        "zh": "评测卡上的 387 个数字全部由脚本从项目的结果文件算出，不手抄。作品集里的每个数字，再用有据可查（evidence-check）对回评测卡。题目和答案跑前冻结；跑完发现题目或答案有错，就公开更正、重跑，原来的数字并排保留，例如模型裁判校准的两次更正。",
        "en": "All 387 numbers on the evaluation cards are computed by script from the projects' result files, never copied by hand. Every number in this portfolio is then checked against the cards with evidence-check. Items and answers are frozen before the runs; when a mistake in an item or answer turns up afterwards, it is corrected in public and run again, with the old numbers kept alongside, as in Judge Calibration's two corrections."
      },
      "sources": [
        {
          "type": "project",
          "id": "evidence-check",
          "label": {
            "zh": "有据可查 evidence-check",
            "en": "evidence-check"
          },
          "url": {
