        "en": [
          "model",
          "which llm",
          "cost",
          "budget",
          "spend",
          "price"
        ]
      },
      "a": {
        "zh": "默认用便宜的 claude-haiku-5-5，不急的大批评测走批量接口，价格减半。需要对照时才加别的模型，例如审核模型实验在本机跑的 Qwen 小模型，模型裁判校准里用 claude-sonnet-5-5 做第二裁判。整个项目的花费，例如 Agent 评测台 1.48 美元，模型裁判校准 2.63 美元，标注 Agent 工具箱 3.6325 美元。",
        "en": "The default is the low-cost claude-haiku-5-5, with large evaluations that are not urgent sent through the batch API at half price. Other models come in only for comparison, such as the small Qwen models Policy Model Lab runs locally, or claude-sonnet-5-5 as a second judge in Judge Calibration. Whole-project spend, for example: Agent Trace Eval US$1.48, Judge Calibration US$2.63, Labelling Agent Kit US$3.6325."
      },
