          "existing tools",
          "alternatives",
          "why not use",
          "reinvent",
          "competitors",
          "what is different"
        ]
      },
      "a": {
        "zh": "开工前都先查过现成的，能用就直接用：例如回归评测用 promptfoo，工具轨迹比对用 agentevals，过程记录导出成 Inspect AI 的日志。补的是它们没管的那一块。例如有据可查只核对数字和原文在不在给定的材料里，不像 RefChecker 那样判断一句话本身对不对；比较写在有据可查、有据经营分析、创作者 Skill 合集的 README 里。",
        "en": "Existing tools were checked first and used where they fit: promptfoo for regression runs, agentevals for comparing tool trajectories, Inspect AI's log format for the traces. What is added is the part they leave out. evidence-check, for instance, only checks whether numbers and quotes are in the given material, rather than judging whether a sentence is true the way RefChecker does; the comparisons are in the READMEs of evidence-check, Grounded Business Review and Creator skills."
      },
