      "a": {
        "zh": "有，都照实写在评测卡里。Agent 评测台事先预测上线前的关卡能拦下大多数失败，结果 17 次失败只拦下 1 次。经营分析的修复把门店定位改对了，回归重测却查出另一道题变差。最大的教训：照失败写的修复要先写预测，再在整组题上重测。",
        "en": "Yes, and the cards say so. Agent Trace Eval predicted the release gates would catch most failures; of 17 failures they caught 1. The business-review fix located store closures correctly, yet the regression run found another task getting worse. The main lesson: a fix written from a failure needs its predictions first and a re-run over the whole family."
      },
