        "en": [
          "production",
          "real world",
          "limitations",
          "risks",
          "deploy",
          "what is missing"
        ]
      },
      "a": {
        "zh": "题目多是合成或虚构的，上线前要用业务里已有结论的样本另建测试集。每题跑的次数少、区间偏宽，重要的结论要多跑几次。要靠外部证据才能定的判断应该留给人：模型裁判在这类监管结论上只对了 6/11。",
        "en": "Most items are synthetic or fictional, so real use needs a test set built from business cases with settled outcomes. Few runs per item leave wide intervals, so key findings need more runs. Decisions that turn on outside evidence should stay with people: the model judge got only 6/11 of such regulator decisions right."
      },
      "sources": [
        {
